@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms of Use";
}

<div class="container mt-5 pt-4">
    <h1 class="mb-4">Terms of Use</h1>
    <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 card-HamsiBus">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
            <h4>Service Agreement</h4>
            <p>By using the HamsiBus platform, you agree to these Terms of Use. They cover search, booking, payment, cancellations, and changes.</p>

            <hr class="my-4" />

            <h5>1) Scope of Service</h5>
            <p>HamsiBus provides a platform to list routes, show seat availability, and complete ticket purchases. Schedule, pricing, and availability data are supplied by carrier companies and may change.</p>

            <h5>2) Account and Information Accuracy</h5>
            <ul class="mb-3">
                <li>You are responsible for keeping login credentials secure.</li>
                <li>Information provided for passengers must be accurate and up to date.</li>
                <li>Transactions made through your account are your responsibility.</li>
            </ul>

            <h5>3) Booking and Payment</h5>
            <p>A reservation is confirmed only after payment is completed. Card data is processed by secure payment providers and is not stored on our servers.</p>

            <h5>4) Cancellations, Refunds, and Changes</h5>
            <p>Cancellation and refund rules vary by carrier. Applicable fees and time limits are shown during checkout and on your ticket.</p>

            <h5>5) Travel Rules</h5>
            <ul class="mb-3">
                <li>Identity checks may be required before departure.</li>
                <li>Baggage, pet, and special item rules are set by carriers.</li>
                <li>Seat selection is subject to real-time availability.</li>
            </ul>

            <h5>6) Delays and Service Issues</h5>
            <p>Carriers are responsible for delays, cancellations, and service quality. HamsiBus acts as an intermediary and assists with support where possible.</p>

            <h5>7) Prohibited Use</h5>
            <p>You may not misuse the platform, attempt unauthorized access, or use automated tools to scrape content without permission.</p>

            <h5>8) Intellectual Property</h5>
            <p>All content, branding, and design elements on the platform belong to HamsiBus and may not be copied or reused without permission.</p>

            <h5>9) Limitation of Liability</h5>
            <p>We are not liable for indirect losses resulting from carrier actions, service interruptions, or external events.</p>

            <h5>10) Changes to Terms</h5>
            <p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the platform means you accept the updated terms.</p>

            <hr class="my-4" />

            <p class="mb-0">Questions? Contact support at support@hamsibus.com</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>